  "contract": "#4747 reports that Tinker pets are immune to Repair Shot, Emergency Heal and Zap!. All five Tinker build pets are CREATURE_TYPE_MECHANICAL, and Creature::IsImmunedToSpellEffect makes every mechanical creature immune to SPELL_EFFECT_HEAL. Repair Shot, Emergency Heal and Zap! are SPELL_EFFECT_HEAL spells at TARGET_UNIT_TARGET_ALLY (family 34), whose tooltips heal an ally, so a player-owned mechanical pet must take the heal. A level 80 Tinker builds Mechano-Bear 803405 (SUMMON_PET 60671), sets it to 1 health, and casts the ranks it owns at level 80, Repair Shot 574152, Emergency Heal 802691 and Zap! 681298, at the pet. Each cast must produce a native heal log with effective healing on the pet; an immune pet produces none.",
